{
    "chapter_num": 1,
    "verses_count": 27,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Greeting to the Twelve Tribes"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "James, a bondservant of God and of the Lord Jesus Christ,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "To the twelve tribes which are scattered abroad:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Greetings."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Profiting from Trials"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "My brethren, count it all joy when you fall into various trials, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "knowing that the testing of your faith produces "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "endurance or perseverance"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "patience. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But let patience have "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "its"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " perfect work, that you may be "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "mature"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "perfect and complete, lacking nothing. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "If any of you lacks wisdom, let him ask of God, who gives to all liberally and without reproach, and it will be given to him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But let him ask in faith, with no doubting, for he who doubts is like a wave of the sea driven and tossed by the wind. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For let not that man suppose that he will receive anything from the Lord; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "he is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a double-minded man, unstable in all his ways."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Perspective of Rich and Poor"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Let the lowly brother glory in his exaltation, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "but the rich in his humiliation, because as a flower of the field he will pass away. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For no sooner has the sun risen with a burning heat than it withers the grass; its flower falls, and its beautiful appearance perishes. So the rich man also will fade away in his pursuits."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Loving God Under Trials"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Blessed "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the man who endures temptation; for when he has been approved, he will receive the crown of life which the Lord has promised to those who love Him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Let no one say when he is tempted, “I am tempted by God”; for God cannot be tempted by evil, nor does He Himself tempt anyone. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But each one is tempted when he is drawn away by his own desires and enticed. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then, when desire has conceived, it gives birth to sin; and sin, when it is full-grown, brings forth death."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Do not be deceived, my beloved brethren. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Every good gift and every perfect gift is from above, and comes down from the Father of lights, with whom there is no variation or shadow of turning. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Of His own will He brought us forth by the word of truth, that we might be a kind of firstfruits of His creatures."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Qualities Needed in Trials"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU Know this or This you know"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So then, my beloved brethren, let every man be swift to hear, slow to speak, slow to wrath; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "for the wrath of man does not produce the righteousness of God."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Doers—Not Hearers Only"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore lay aside all filthiness and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "abundance"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "overflow of wickedness, and receive with meekness the implanted word, which is able to save your souls."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But be doers of the word, and not hearers only, deceiving yourselves. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For if anyone is a hearer of the word and not a doer, he is like a man observing his natural face in a mirror; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "for he observes himself, goes away, and immediately forgets what kind of man he was. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But he who looks into the perfect law of liberty and continues "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "in it,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and is not a forgetful hearer but a doer of the work, this one will be blessed in what he does."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "If anyone "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits among you"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "among you thinks he is religious, and does not bridle his tongue but deceives his own heart, this one’s religion "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " useless. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Pure and undefiled religion before God and the Father is this: to visit orphans and widows in their trouble, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to keep oneself unspotted from the world."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}